<title>LATVIA: NOON RADIO HEADLINES-AUG 5.</title>
<headline>NOON RADIO HEADLINES-AUG 5.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the headlines on Latvian state radio's noon news programme. Reuters has not verified these headlines and does not vouch for their accuracy:</p>
<p>- The head of Latvia's airforce, Colonel Karlis Kins, was killed in a car accident.</p>
<p>- The parties which plan to form the government of Prime Minister Guntar Krasts are to agree today the final version of the government declaration, containing the new administrations's programme.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
